Z||000000||84 Indy||06-16-2000||08:27 PM||||I'm thinking about putting a 3.8sc in my 84 SE.  Has anyone done this in their car?  What about a/c if so which Fiero or 3.8?<BR>Which Alt. Fiero or 3.8 <BR>[This message has been edited by 84 Indy (edited 06-16-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by 84 Indy (edited 06-18-2000).]||||reg||1
