Z||000006||Big O||06-18-2000||01:55 AM||||Mine is a four speed automatic.  Not much for squeeling the tires unless you punch it from a rolling start, but it still goes like stink.  When you get to be my age you don't have much of a need to pump your ego by burning rubber anyway.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Shiner||06-18-2000||02:19 AM||||I would love to put a 3.8 in my GT, but is there a way to use a MANUAL transmission with it?  Does the 3.8 bolt up to the getrag or not?  <P> You see, I am young, and I love burning rubber.  If I am going to put thousands of dollars into an engine swap, I want that sucker to twitch sideways on a 2-3 powershift  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||stimpy||06-18-2000||11:02 AM||||Everthing is possible, how fat is you wallet, and how skinny can it get?<BR>Since the 3.8 share basic design wit the small block Chevy, I would assume some of the conversion people could adapt it to work.||||reg||1
Z||000009||Formula 18||06-18-2000||10:14 PM||||I know you CAN bolt up a 3800SC to a getrag. Check out ACE Engine swaps. The sell a kit to do it and give you info on how to. the address is <A HREF="http://www.americancustomeng.com." TARGET=_blank>www.americancustomeng.com.</A>  I hope that helps. <BR>Brian ||||reg||1
Z||000010||Dan86gt3.8||06-19-2000||12:37 PM||||Yes the getrag or the muncie bolt right up, so does the isuzu but it is alott weaker than the getrags and muncies so most people recomend that you do not use them.  I went with ace the link above (american custom engineering) and there is another guy out in california that does this named chris west, I think he is a member of the forum the link to his place is <A HREF="http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/" TARGET=_blank>http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/</A>   <BR>If you go with the manual a custom flywheel hast to be made and if you want any longevity you need to upgrade to a serious clutch.  The ace kit to use a manual is a couple hundred dollars more, because it invovles extra work.  But the bell housing bolts right up with no modification that fact has neverr ben disputed so I will go ahead and believe it to be true.  Anyways good luck and hope you can do the swap because it is a great one!||||reg||1
